 server management and monitoring, helping IT administrators efficiently manage server health, configuration, and maintenance.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>HPE ProLiant DL360 Gen10 1U Rack Server</li><li>Intel Xeon Scalable processor support</li><li>DDR4 HPE SmartMemory support</li><li>Up to 24 DIMM slots</li><li>Flexible SFF storage configurations</li><li>Supports SAS, SATA and NVMe storage options depending on configuration</li><li>PCIe expansion capability</li><li>HPE Smart Array storage controller support</li><li>HPE iLO 5 remote server management</li><li>High-speed Ethernet networking options</li><li>Compact 1U rack-mount design</li><li>Enterprise-grade reliability and scalability</li><li>Suitable for virtualization and data center workloads</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/hpe-proliant-dl380-gen10-server\">HPE ProLiant DL380 Gen10 Server</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n  